# LF everywhere, as dart format writes it and as the checks expect it.
* text eol=lf
# ...but images and builds as they are: a PNG's signature holds a CRLF that the
# rule above would rewrite.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.wasm binary
*.zip binary

# The fixtures are byte for byte what an older version wrote and other versions
# read (vault, export, sync file, kem1, manifest, OPAQUE, test vectors): never
# convert their line endings, and never regenerate them.
test/fixtures/** -text
